<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34397" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπλέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sail in</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλοίοις</span>]
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.184
			</span></i>: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἐμπλέοντες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.77
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				8.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in 
				Ion.
			 form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπλεκ-πλώω</span></b> , <i>float in</i> or <i>upon</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				426
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				1.260
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνιπ-</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SD</u>
				1.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.1
			</span></i>: part.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμπλέων</span>
			<i>loose</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῶρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Heliod.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				45.6.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, of the sea, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πελάγη ναυσὶν ἐμπλεόμενα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.28
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.514
			</span></i>.</div>
